.TH L10N-CONV 1 "2026-02-15" "Daniel Nylander" "l10n-conv Manual"
.SH NAME
l10n-conv - Universal localization file converter, validator, and compiler
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B l10n-conv
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I COMMAND
.RI [ ARGS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBl10n-conv\fR is a universal localization file converter, validator, and compiler supporting 16+ formats including Gettext PO/MO, Qt TS, XLIFF, Java Properties, Android XML, iOS Strings, JSON, YAML, CSV/TSV, TMX, TBX, PHP, ARB, Fluent, and Windows RESX.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Show version number and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Verbose output.
.TP
.B \-\-about
Show application info and exit.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B convert
Convert between localization file formats.
.RS
.TP
.I INPUT
Input file path.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFMT\fR
Input format.
.TP
.BR \-\-to " " \fIFMT\fR
Output format.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Output file (\- for stdout).
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Show what would be done.
.TP
.B \-\-batch
Process directory recursively.
.RE
.TP
.B compile
Compile translation files (e.g., PO to MO).
.RS
.TP
.I INPUT
Input file path.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Output file (required).
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Show what would be done.
.RE
.TP
.B extract
Extract translatable strings from source code.
.RS
.TP
.I SOURCE_DIR
Source directory.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Output file (required).
.RE
.TP
.B check
Validate a translation file.
.RS
.TP
.I FILE
File to check.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIFMT\fR
File format.
.RE
.TP
.B stats
Show statistics for a translation file.
.RS
.TP
.I FILE
File to analyze.
.RE
.TP
.B merge
Merge two translation files.
.RS
.TP
.I BASE
Base file.
.TP
.I UPDATE
Update file.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Output file.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Show what would be done.
.RE
.TP
.B diff
Compare two translation files.
.RS
.TP
.I FILE1
First file.
.TP
.I FILE2
Second file.
.RE
.TP
.B init
Create a new translation file from a template.
.RS
.TP
.I TEMPLATE
Template file.
.TP
.I LANG
Target language code.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Output file.
.RE
.TP
.B formats
List all supported formats.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
l10n-conv convert messages.po --to json -o messages.json
l10n-conv compile messages.po -o messages.mo
l10n-conv check translations.xliff
l10n-conv stats messages.po
l10n-conv merge base.po update.po -o merged.po
l10n-conv diff old.po new.po
l10n-conv init template.pot sv -o sv.po
l10n-conv formats
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/l10n-conv/
Configuration files.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/l10n-conv/
Cached data.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/yeager/l10n-conv/issues
